                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I toured Hamilton Memorial Hospital in McLeansboro and spoke with CEO Victoria Woodrow and CFO Justin Epperson about the vital role Critical Access Hospitals and Rural Health Clinics play in Southern Illinois. As healthcare continues to shift toward outpatient services, facilities like Hamilton are adapting to meet the needs of our communities. I\u2019ll keep working to make sure rural families have access to quality care close to home.",
