                "text": "Honored to work closely with the dedicated professionals from the American Association of Nurse Anesthesiology who dedicate themselves to ensuring patients, including our veterans, get the effective care they deserve. I recently met with AANA stakeholders during their yearly D.C. fly-in, including constituents Chris Bourget from Okawville, Jennifer Clevenger from Marion, and Kimberly King from Fairfield. Thanks for all you do!",
